  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">La sede del Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este viernes la presentaci&oacute;n de los dos libros con los poemas en castellano y valenciano ganadores del XLIX&nbsp;Certamen Nacional Literario Ateneo Onda.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_9103.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">En un acto presentado por la secretaria de la entidad, Carmen Arrando Olucha, Alejandro Torres Cano, autor de Tierra de viento vivo, y Francesc M. Ballester i S&aacute;nchez, autor de Cr&ograve;nica de p&egrave;rdua i reparaci&oacute;, han le&iacute;do algunos de sus poemas y han firmado ejemplares de sus respectivos libros.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9102.jpg\" alt=\"img_9102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9103.jpg\" alt=\"img_9103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9104.jpg\" alt=\"img_9104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9105.jpg\" alt=\"img_9105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9106.jpg\" alt=\"img_9106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9107.jpg\" alt=\"img_9107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9108.jpg\" alt=\"img_9108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9109.jpg\" alt=\"img_9109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9110.jpg\" alt=\"img_9110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9112.jpg\" alt=\"img_9112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9114.jpg\" alt=\"img_9114\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9115.jpg\" alt=\"img_9115\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9117.jpg\" alt=\"img_9117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9118.jpg\" alt=\"img_9118\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenpremispoesiaateneu13/img_9119.jpg\" alt=\"img_9119\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
